# Optional. Palpito works fully without this.
#
# The composer reads sentences with a deterministic parser first — it handles
# the phrasings people actually type, instantly and offline, so a fresh clone
# needs no configuration at all.
#
# Set a key to also enable the model fallback (/api/parse). That path handles
# knottier phrasing and, more usefully, explains what this venue cannot do:
# "will América win on Sunday" gets a real answer instead of a shrug, because
# DreamDEX event contracts are BTC/ETH price windows and nothing else.
#
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
